 "change": "DEV3 08-1 U4 (dev3-tree-smo.md#unlink-u4): native fault cuts UNL-N01..N06 of one live unlink of an emptied RowLeaf, LeafUnlink and RootCollapse each (12 histories, 38 processes PASS at the run commit; memory twins and the inventory rule test in CI, an ignored native worker and its stdlib controller with a frozen inventory), and a test-only per-trace log bound in the native test adapter. No product code changes. The DEV3 schedule baseline credits 08-1 on merge (35/86 = 40.70%). PR #59 follow-up: reject short/empty I/O and unsuccessful or wrong-selector barriers in the native controller; add eight independent negative-vector tests.",
